# Local-only Worker environment. Copy to `.dev.vars` (gitignored) and adjust.
#
#   cp worker/.dev.vars.example worker/.dev.vars
#
# `wrangler dev` loads .dev.vars automatically. These never leave your machine.
# Production equivalents are set as real Worker secrets:
#
#   cd worker && npx wrangler secret put SESSION_SECRET
#
# Signs room session cookies. Any non-empty string works locally; production
# must use a strong random value (scripts/setup-secrets.ps1 generates one).
SESSION_SECRET="local-dev-only-not-a-real-secret"

# Optional. Enables TV-photo score analysis; the feature degrades gracefully
# when absent, so leave it unset unless you are working on that flow.
# GEMINI_API_KEY=""

# Optional. Guards POST /internal/squads/sync.
# SQUAD_SYNC_ADMIN_SECRET=""
